OL,3,GNEWSA'Pocket park' opens next to
OL,4,Amedieval abbey
OL,5,
OL,6,FA "pocket park" has opened as part of
OL,7,Fefforts to improve a heritage-rich part
OL,8,Fof Shrewsbury.
OL,10,FThe Abbey Foregate site offers people a
OL,11,Fplace to sit, bikes to hire, and free
OL,12,Fpublic WiFi.
OL,14,FIt was transformed from fenced-off,
OL,15,Fdisused, overgrown land during the
OL,16,Fsummer, with the hope of encouraging
OL,17,Fmore visitors to stop and enjoy the
OL,18,Farea on one of the main routes into
OL,19,Ftown.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
