OL,3,GNEWSA'Pocket park' opens next to
OL,4,Amedieval abbey
OL,5,
OL,6,F"You can't help but see what a
OL,7,Fwonderful community space it is," said
OL,8,Flocal businessman Martin Monahan, who
OL,9,Fhas been one of the main backers of the
OL,10,Fproject.
